strmqt (0.9.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * TVs watching the streaming host together play in step: the host keeps
    time for them (UDP 8339) and tells every StrmLight how far behind it to
    play, so two rooms sound as one, with no echo.

 -- Mike Pengelly <mike@leadrix.io>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000

strmqt (0.9.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Only StrmLight streams from the streaming host, and StrmLight streams
    only from the Sunshine its StrmQt vouches for.
  * The host's Sunshine moves to StrmQt's own ports, 8330-8356.
  * Picture, sound and screen scale for StrmLight are set in StrmQt.
  * Settings has YouTube, Mobile Web Remote and StrmLight sections.
  * The host no longer overwrites the desktop's display settings, and its
    Sunshine stays out of the system tray.

 -- Mike Pengelly <mike@leadrix.io>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

strmqt (0.9.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The streaming host: StrmQt on a hidden desktop with a Sunshine and a
    PipeWire of its own, for StrmLight on a Fire TV or Android TV, found on
    the network and paired with one code.
  * The phone remote pairs with a code shown on screen and works signed out.
  * An on-screen keyboard, a featured title on Home, logos, gapless music
    with mpv.

 -- Mike Pengelly <mike@leadrix.io>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0000

strmqt (0.8.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * YouTube's TV interface and YouTube Music as destinations in the menu,
    driven with the same arrows as the rest of the app; what they play goes
    on under other pages. Each can be switched off in Settings.
  * Trailers play in the app; full screen can be toggled from the profile
    menu.
  * New dependencies: Qt WebEngine, SQLite.

 -- Mike Pengelly <mike@leadrix.io>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:30:00 +0000

strmqt (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * One input layer for keyboard, mouse, controller, remote and phone: an
    arrow always has somewhere to go, and every control can be reached.
  * Films and shows can be filtered by genre, year, studio, rating and, for
    films, resolution, HDR format, codec and audio layout.
  * An idle pointer hides and stops hovering; video upscaling (mpv engine).

 -- Mike Pengelly <mike@leadrix.io>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

strmqt (0.7.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Distro compatibility release: native packages for Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04,
    Debian 12 and 13; Qt 6.4.2 or newer; KWallet 5 and Secret Service keyrings.

